{27}{Let me give you some advice @pcname@. In our line of work, it isn't exactly wise to be telling strangers too much about yourself. But rest at ease laddie, you are in no danger with Phineas McGee. [Laughing] You seem to be an honest thief!}{Let me give you some advice @pcname@. In our line of work, it isn't exactly wise to be telling strangers too much about yourself. But rest at ease missy, you are in no danger with Phineas McGee. [Laughing] You seem to be an honest thief!}{}{}{}{}
