{44}{What do you have against Pollock?}{}{5}{}{46}{}
{45}{What can you tell me about Ashbury?}{}{5}{}{91}{}
{46}{Well that's a long story, but it was Pollock that ended my professional career.  Curse him!, Curse the day he was born!}{Well that's a long story, but it was Pollock that ended my professional career.  Curse him!, Curse the day he was born!}{}{}{}{}
{47}{I see, could you tell me a little more about it.}{}{5}{}{50}{}
{48}{Sorry for you troubles, but I just have a few questions.}{}{5}{}{91}{}
{49}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{50}{It was partly my fault, I admit it. I was new to Tarant and I didn't know anything. Especially, about the gangs in the Boil. So there I was, in a tavern called Celeb Malloy's, practicing my profession on the locals. I see a big dumb looking Half-Ogre whose purse is busting at its seams. Just begging for me to take it.}{It was partly my fault, I admit it. I was new to Tarant and I didn't know anything. Especially, about the gangs in the Boil. So there I was, in a tavern called Celeb Malloy's, practicing my profession on the locals. I see a big dumb looking Half-Ogre whose purse is busting at its seams. Just begging for me to take it.}{}{}{}{}
{51}{It would have been hard to resist such an opportunity.}{}{5}{}{54}{re +5}
{52}{I would have advised caution under similar circumstances.}{}{5}{}{54}{}
{53}{E:}{}{}{}{}{}
{54}{Well the Half-Ogre wasn't as dumb as he looked. When I went to cut his purse, he got wise to it real quick, and before I knew what hit me, he was holding me upside down by my ankle and screaming and yelling about teaching me a lesson! ...about, teaching everyone a lesson... A lesson about never crossing Pollock!}{Well the Half-Ogre wasn't as dumb as he looked. When I went to cut his purse, he got wise to it real quick, and before I knew what hit me, he was holding me upside down by my ankle and screaming and yelling about teaching me a lesson! ...about, teaching everyone a lesson... A lesson about never crossing Pollock!}{}{}{}{}
{55}{Oh my word. How terrible!}{}{5}{}{59}{re +5}
{56}{Let me guess... this story does not end well for you.}{}{5}{}{59}{}
{57}{E:}{}{}{}{}{}
{58}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{59}{I didn't know what he was going to do, but I started begging for mercy! You know begging for my life! And Pollock got this crazy Half-Ogre smile, and he says to me, "You ain't never going steal nothing again!"}{I didn't know what he was going to do, but I started begging for mercy! You know begging for my life! And Pollock got this crazy Half-Ogre smile, and he says to me, "You ain't never going steal nothing again!"}{}{}{}{}
{60}{What did he mean by that?}{}{5}{}{64}{}
{61}{[You see his deformed hands] You don't have to tell me.}{}{5}{pe 13}{70}{re +10}
{62}{E:}{}{}{}{}{}
{63}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{64}{[he holds up his hands] This curse him! This is what he meant by it! He grabbed my hands and started squeezing with all of his Half-Ogre strength. Laughing he was. I can still see his ugly face smiling as he crushed my hands. Damn that dog! Look...He broke every bone!}{[he holds up his hands] This curse him! This is what he meant by it! He grabbed my hands and started squeezing with all of his Half-Ogre strength. Laughing he was. I can still see his ugly face smiling as he crushed my hands. Damn that dog! Look...He broke every bone!}{}{}{}{}
{65}{Is there anything I can do to help?}{}{5}{}{70}{re +7}
{66}{Tough lesson my friend.}{}{5}{}{70}{}
{67}{E:}{}{5}{}{}{}
{68}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{69}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{70}{It ain't so bad... I still make out okay. I just have to be more careful about my projects... I try to keep to myself too. I don't want anymore trouble with the Pollock gang.  Heh Heh! Ashbury is sort of like retirement compared to the Boil.}{It ain't so bad... I still make out okay. I just have to be more careful about my projects... I try to keep to myself too. I don't want anymore trouble with the Pollock gang.  Heh Heh! Ashbury is sort of like retirement compared to the Boil.}{}{}{}{lf3 1}
{71}{What kind of projects are you talking about?}{}{5}{re 80}{76}{}
{72}{What would it be worth to you to see Pollock dead?}{}{5}{re 60, rp -40, gf2187 0}{84}{}
{73}{Yes, This is a much nicer place!}{}{5}{}{91}{}
{74}{E:}{}{5}{}{}{}
{75}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{76}{Well, for instance, I only take low risk jobs. Like working the crowds in Tarant, or like these pitiful Town meetings here in Ashbury. Folks are distracted and not watching their pockets. Heh! Even with these hands I can still filch a purse or two. Just don't get too greedy, and be sure to be out of there before the meeting ends!}{Well, for instance, I only take low risk jobs. Like working the crowds in Tarant, or like these pitiful Town meetings here in Ashbury. Folks are distracted and not watching their pockets. Heh! Even with these hands I can still filch a purse or two. Just don't get too greedy, and be sure to be out of there before the meeting ends!}{}{}{}{lf0 1}
{77}{Very interesting.}{}{5}{}{80}{}
{78}{E:}{}{5}{}{}{}
{79}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{80}{It is the oldest trick in the book! When folks got their attention fixed somewhere else it is easy pickings friend! Just be quick about it, and don't stay around to see what happens.}{It is the oldest trick in the book! When folks got their attention fixed somewhere else it is easy pickings friend! Just be quick about it, and don't stay around to see what happens.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{Thanks for the lesson Phineas.}{}{5}{}{91}{}
{82}{What can you tell me about the next meeting?}{}{5}{}{98}{}
{83}{E:}{}{5}{}{}{}
{84}{Hey, well I don't want any more trouble with the Pollock gang. But I could say that If you were to tell me he was dead, I would appreciate hearing the news.}{Hey, well I don't want any more trouble with the Pollock gang. But I could say that If you were to tell me he was dead, I would appreciate hearing the news.}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
